\par\par \b \uc2 EXCHANGE --- Striking Actors Told Not to Dress Up As Movie, TV Characters for Halloween\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alyssa Lukpat \par \uc2 311 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 October 2023\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B9\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2023 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Striking actors this Halloween are facing a choice: Trick or traitor?\par \par \uc2 Their union told members not to dress as characters from popular movies and TV shows, as that breaks strike rules, or post photos of those costumes on social media.\par \par \uc2 "Let's use our collective power to send a loud and clear message to our struck employers that we will not promote their content without a fair contract," the Screen Actors Guild -- \uc2 American Federation of Television and Radio Artists\uc2  said. That means no Barbie or Wednesday Addams costumes for actors this year.\par \par \uc2 SAG\uc2  suggested dressing up as an animated character instead, as those aren't included in the strike, or as generic ghosts, zombies or spiders.\par \par \uc2 SAG\uc2  didn't immediately return a request for comment Friday.\par \par \uc2 The labor dispute will reach its 100th day this weekend and could overlap with Halloween. Actors are feuding with Hollywood studios and streamers over issues including pay, artificial intelligence protections and streaming revenue. Talks have stalled.\par \par \uc2 SAG\uc2 's Halloween guidance inspired jokes on social media, with some people saying the measure was extreme. Others said they understood the reasons behind the move. "I look forward to screaming 'scab' at my 8 year old all night," the actor Ryan Reynolds wrote in a post, using the nickname for employees who work during a strike. "She's not in the union but she needs to learn."\par \par \uc2 The actress Mandy Moore criticized the guidance.\par \par \uc2 "Is this a joke? Come on @sagaftra," Moore said on \uc2 Instagram\uc2  Thursday. "We're asking you to negotiate in good faith on our behalf. So many folks across every aspect of this industry have been sacrificing mightily for months. Get back to the table and get a fair deal so everyone can get back to work."\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020231021ejal0001r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
